OL,3,GNEWSAFoot 'pointed wrong way' after
OL,4,Adrug farm roof jump
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who jumped from the roof of a
OL,7,Fdrugs farm in a bid to escape a police
OL,8,Fraid was left heavily bleeding and with
OL,9,Fhis foot "pointing the wrong way", a
OL,10,Fcourt heard.
OL,12,FJuraj Toli, of Enfield, north London,
OL,13,Fwho said he was "forced" to cultivate
OL,14,Fcannabis to pay off the cost of his
OL,15,Ftravel to the UK from Germany, was one
OL,16,Fof three men who leapt to evade
OL,17,Fofficers at the former Pagoda nightclub
OL,18,Fon Carlisle's Lancaster Street on 10
OL,19,FMay 2023.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
