OL,3,GNEWSAFoot 'pointed wrong way' after
OL,4,Adrug farm roof jump
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 30-year-old Albanian national was
OL,7,Fairlifted to hospital having sustained
OL,8,Fextensive fractures that required the
OL,9,Ffitting of surgical screws and plates.
OL,11,FToli was found guilty at Carlisle Crown
OL,12,FCourt of cannabis production and
OL,13,Fsentenced to 30 months in jail.
